Author: Carsten Schmitz <carsten.schmitz@limesurvey.org>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 00:01:33 2026 +0100

    Fixed issue: Database update to 7.0 failed with "Incorrect decimal value" or mixed other answers into a ranking question when another question's column name looked like one of its rank columns
    Dev compactLegacyRankingValues() treated every existing {sid}X{gid}X{qid}{n} column as a rank slot, e.g. the column of question 13 as rank 3 of question 1; it now only uses columns the field map assigns to the ranking question or leaves unmapped

